Jikun/quicklook","privacyUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun/quicklook/blob/main/PRIVACY.md","publisher":"GuoJikun","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun/quicklook/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun","releaseNotes":"- feat: 新增国际化支持，界面可选简体中文 / English，默认简体中文，语言设置持久化并在各窗口间同步\n- feat: 托盘菜单、系统对话框与窗口标题随语言切换，托盘菜单在语言变更后即时重建\n- feat: 视频播放器控件语言、Element Plus 组件语言跟随应用语言\n- feat: 图片预览新增旋转（左右各 90°）、适应窗口、实际大小 1:1 与全屏\n- feat: 图片默认改为适应窗口显示，修复大图打开后只显示左上角的问题\n- feat: 图片预览支持双击在适应窗口与实际大小之间切换\n- feat: 音频预览新增 wav / flac / opus，均由 WebView2 原生解码，无需后端转码\n- fix: 设置页「支持的格式」补齐音频分类（此前遗漏，仅展示 9 类）\n- fix: 文件大小缺失时页脚显示「NaN TB」，改为回退为占位符（「暂不支持」页与预览数据就绪前会触发）\n- feat: 随包分发精简版 ffmpeg/ffprobe，不再依赖系统安装或 PATH 中的 ffmpeg\n- feat: 视频转码改用 Media Foundation（h264_mf）编码，移除 libx264，规避 GPL 分发义务\n- perf: ffmpeg 按白名单裁剪，217 MB → 10.7 MB；ffprobe 改为独立极简构建，18 MB → 4.3 MB\n- fix: ffprobe 补入 aac 解码器，修复 ts/m2ts 内 AAC 的采样率与声道数探测为 0\n- ci: 打包前自动构建随包 ffmpeg，补齐 arm64 交叉编译，并新增 fmt/clippy/test 门禁\n- refactor: 抽取 quicklook-cache 统一缓存逻辑，PDF 文档缓存改为 LRU 多文档\n- refactor: 统一错误类型为 QuickLookError 并保留错误链\n- chore: 移除 capi C FFI 导出、未使用的 IPC 命令与死代码\n- chore: 升级 Tauri 相关依赖\n- test: 补充纯函数单元测试，内联用例迁移到独立测试文件","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun/quicklook/releases/tag/v0.26.0","tags":["docx","excel","pdf","preview","quicklook","tauri","windows"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun/quicklook/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/GuoJikun/quicklook/releases/tag/v0.26.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"411ee5b30152224ab652f0629684a360adabd366","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/g/GuoJikun/QuickLook/0.26.0/GuoJikun.QuickLook.installer.yaml","sha256":"001892448ca725925269d0fe0d7de9791c13b0aa36daccf860fd224df6d65eb1"},{"path":"manifests/g/GuoJikun/QuickLook/0.26.0/GuoJikun.QuickLook.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"7d57c6534a26c2a87b9fda2afb5e4